{"unit_id":"tag:0CEX:proof","translation":"这可以用与引理<REF_0001>完全相同的方法证明。另一种方法是利用如下事实：拓扑空间（topological spaces）的映射（map）是同胚（homeomorphism），当且仅当它是单射（injective）、满射（surjective）且开（open）的。因此，普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism）就是满射（surjective）、普遍的单射（injective）且普遍开（universally open）的态射（morphism）。于是本引理由引理<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>和<REF_0004>得到。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"homeomorphism","target_term":"同胚"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"universal homeomorphism","target_term":"普遍同胚"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"universally open","target_term":"普遍开"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"拓扑映射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"拓扑映射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"homeomorphism","target_term":"同胚","context":"拓扑同胚；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"映射性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"映射性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开","context":"开映射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"universal homeomorphism","target_term":"普遍同胚","context":"态射性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"universally open","target_term":"普遍开","context":"态射性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"概形态射；词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
