{"unit_id":"tag:02KY:proof","translation":"局部有限呈示（locally of finite presentation）性质在基变换（base change）下保持，见态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0001>。局部有限型（locally of finite type）性质在基底上是Zariski局部的，见态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0002>。最后，设<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affine schemes）的平坦（flat）满射（surjective）态射（morphism），并设<MATH_0002>是一个态射（morphism）。假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0003>是局部有限呈示（locally of finite presentation）的。设<MATH_0004>是一个仿射开集（affine open）。则<MATH_0005>是仿射（affine）的，且在<MATH_0006>上是有限型（finite type）的。记<MATH_0007>、<MATH_0008>、<MATH_0009>及<MATH_0010>。我们知道<MATH_0011>是忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的，<MATH_0012>且<MATH_0013>是有限呈示（finite presentation）的。我们须证明<MATH_0014>是有限呈示（finite presentation）的。这正是代数（Algebra），引理<REF_0003>的结果。由此可知<MATH_0015>是局部有限呈示（locally of finite presentation）的。因此可以应用引理<REF_0004>，所需结论成立。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示","context":"态射性质；词表未批